/target

# Working artifacts kept in clear on disk but NOT versioned.
# sessions/: per-repo session handoffs (local working state).
# prompts/:  delegation briefs for external agents (transient per feature).
# archive/:  raw session archives (transient per feature).
# .pi/:      external coding-agent review reports/plans (transient tooling output).
# docs/ is intentionally NOT ignored: design docs stay versioned on this private
# repo and are later moved to nxm-docs by dedicated scripts (see RULES.md).
# Rete di sicurezza: nessun file di sessione/registry deve mai stare in root.
/registry.json
/registry.jsonl
/ses_*.md
/sessions/
/prompts/
/archive/
/.pi/
